                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>Loy W. Henderson, on October 4, addressed the Wellesley Club in Washington, D.C.,
                    on “American Aid to Greece—A Step toward Lasting Peace”; for the text of his
                    address, see Department of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, October
                    19, 1947, page 772.</p>
            </div>
